# Acceptance evidence is local. It carries machine paths, session identifiers
# and, in one case, 74MB of another project's build output that was never ours
# to redistribute. The files stay on disk and REFERENCES.md keeps the readable
# summary; what is already in history is removed the day this goes public.
/evidence/

